Subject: [PATCH] sandbox: read-only database role for the support agent

 agent_ro can SELECT from the catalog schema and nothing else; its transactions are read-only and time out after 5 seconds.
---
 src/postgresql/init.sql | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

